---
title: "Controllers reached through the client"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Not watched
  s1: Watched: no client linked
  s2: Watched: waiting for the client
  s3: Unfocused: nothing held
  s4: Live
  s5: Not watched: the client still reading
  s6: Stale: last state kept
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a mod watches the player
  s1 --> s0: the watch ends
  s1 --> s2: the player's client links
  s0 --> s2: a mod watches the player
  s2 --> s1: the link drops or the client exits
  s2 --> s0: the watch ends
  s2 --> s3: a frame arrives
  s2 --> s5: the watch ends
  s2 --> s4: a frame arrives
  s3 --> s1: the link drops or the client exits
  s3 --> s5: the watch ends
  s4 --> s1: the link drops or the client exits
  s4 --> s5: the watch ends
  s5 --> s0: the link drops or the client exits or the client closes the devices
  s3 --> s6: no frame before the deadline
  s4 --> s6: no frame before the deadline
  s6 --> s1: the link drops or the client exits
  s6 --> s5: the watch ends
  s4 --> s3: a frame arrives
  s3 --> s4: a frame arrives
  s6 --> s3: a frame arrives
  s6 --> s4: a frame arrives
